		{
			"id": "TdtXAi4pelDbr5lIP",
			"name": "Telekinesis",
			"local_notes": "Lore: Force of will made physical: hurled objects, barriers of solid air, crushing grips, and — at its rarest and most dangerous — stepping instantly from one place to another. Calibrated against Dark Heresy's Telekinesis list (Assail, Kinetic Barrier/Shield, Crush, Warp Conduit/Gate of Infinity all map closely).\n\nDesign: Talent-linked group; see each child.",
			"tags": [
				"Advantage",
				"Mental",
				"Psyker",
				"Imperium"
			],
			"children": [
				{
					"id": "tpTAv3vc7HVMcvUM4",
					"name": "Assail",
					"local_notes": "Lore: Hurls the nearest loose object, or the target themselves, with bruising force.\n\nDesign: Innate Attack (Crushing, 5/die, B61) with Warp/Perils.",
					"tags": [
						"Advantage",
						"Mental",
						"Psyker",
						"Imperium"
					],
					"modifiers": [
						{
							"id": "mPCT8SLEZjeb6e0jM",
							"name": "Warp",
							"cost_adj": "-15%"
						},
						{
							"id": "mlKRPhUsarsbJOKJp",
							"name": "Perils of the Warp",
							"cost_adj": "-10%"
						}
					],
					"points_per_level": 5,
					"can_level": true,
					"levels": 1
				},
				{
					"id": "Th73HnX3BhT9_T31Y",
					"name": "Force Dome/Kinetic Shield",
					"local_notes": "Lore: The same telekinetic barrier, bought as one power: held tight around the caster alone, or opened out to cover the whole squad.\n\nDesign: Alternative_abilities container; full price for the costlier Force Dome plus a fifth of Kinetic Shield.",
					"tags": [
						"Advantage",
						"Mental",
						"Psyker",
						"Imperium"
					],
					"container_type": "alternative_abilities",
					"children": [
						{
							"id": "tWUwJc1ZgFP34zuy1",
							"name": "Kinetic Shield",
							"local_notes": "Lore: A tight telekinetic skin around the caster alone.\n\nDesign: Damage Resistance (5/level, B), self only, with Warp/Perils.",
							"tags": [
								"Advantage",
								"Mental",
								"Psyker",
								"Imperium"
							],
							"modifiers": [
								{
									"id": "mgdHwuDst2EArAKHT",
									"name": "Warp",
									"cost_adj": "-15%"
								},
								{
									"id": "mwITTz-j2P1vEYr36",
									"name": "Perils of the Warp",
									"cost_adj": "-10%"
								}
							],
							"points_per_level": 5,
							"can_level": true,
							"levels": 1
						},
						{
							"id": "tpN0Ool5nEBPhbcK2",
							"name": "Force Dome",
							"local_notes": "Lore: A dome of solid force wide enough to cover the caster's whole fireteam.\n\nDesign: Damage Resistance (5/level) with Area Effect (+50%, B102, 2-yard radius) plus Warp/Perils.",
							"tags": [
								"Advantage",
								"Mental",
								"Psyker",
								"Imperium"
							],
							"modifiers": [
								{
									"id": "mQVQmX469wb8ygk9I",
									"name": "Area Effect",
									"cost_adj": "+50%"
								},
								{
