					"name": "Terrify",
					"local_notes": "Lore: Projects raw, focused fear straight into a target's mind.\n\nDesign: Terror, Basic's core advantage (flat 30 + 10/level for extra range), with Warp/Perils.",
					"tags": [
						"Advantage",
						"Mental",
						"Psyker",
						"Imperium"
