			"children": [
				{
					"id": "t43_vlUo3GY7HEDnf",
					"name": "Banishment",
					"local_notes": "Lore: A bolt of purifying anti-warp force that tears a daemon's physical anchor apart.\n\nDesign: Innate Attack (Impaling, 8/die, B61) restricted to warp-touched targets (Accessibility -10%, kept small since daemons are this unit's routine enemy, not a rare case) plus Warp and the Severe Perils tier.",
