					"id": "tbHAy_Yrod0aw1rWw",
					"name": "Sanctuary",
					"local_notes": "Lore: Wards a Grey Knight kill-team against fear, corruption, and possession during a purge.\n\nDesign: Affliction (10, delivering a +15-point protective advantage to willing allies rather than a disadvantage to a foe — Basic B35 allows either) with Area Effect (+50%), Warp, and Severe Perils.",
