							"id": "tM9rNUef83d3vn74r",
							"name": "Heroic Feats of Strength",
							"local_notes": "Lore: See parent trait.\n\nDesign: Basic's Heroic Feats of Strength (flat 10) with Area Effect plus Warp/Perils.",
